## 0. NON-NEGOTIABLE RULES

1. Build the **entire** page, hero to footer. Do not stop after the hero or the first product grid.
2. Frontend only. **No Firebase, no backend, no Gemini API calls, no secrets in client code.** Don't use any Google AI Studio runtime services. The project must run anywhere and deploy to Vercel.
3. Stack: **React + Vite + Tailwind CSS** only. No Bootstrap, Material UI, Chakra, or other UI kits. No router (single page, hash anchors). Optional: at most two Aceternity-style components if genuinely useful (they may add only `motion`, `clsx` and `tailwind-merge`); otherwise skip.
4. Fonts: **Bricolage Grotesque** (primary) and **DM Sans** (secondary) only. No third font by default.
5. All data is **demo data**. Do not claim payments, auth or newsletter delivery are real. Label demo behaviour in the UI copy where it matters (checkout, newsletter, account).
6. Code must run with `npm install`, `npm run dev`, `npm run build` (output in `dist/`). No broken imports, dead buttons, TODO stubs or unfinished components.
7. Don't use glassmorphism aesthetics, glows, heavy shadows, random gradients or generic SaaS patterns.
8. Don't claim "pixel-perfect" unless you've actually compared screenshots of your build to the references.

