## 8. MOTION

- Subtle section reveal: opacity 0→1 and translateY 16px→0, 500–600ms, ease-out, once per element, via a small `useReveal` hook with IntersectionObserver (no animation library needed).
- Image hover zoom, button transitions, card transitions, carousel scroll-snap, drawer slide (260ms) with backdrop fade.
- **`prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`** disables reveals, hover zoom, smooth scroll and drawer slides (instant state changes).
- No parallax, no auto-playing animation, nothing that delays LCP.

